WEBVTT

01:46.680 --> 01:47.560
Getting discharged?

01:48.680 --> 01:49.160
Drop the

01:49.160 --> 01:50.120
fake concern.

01:50.960 --> 01:51.800
I owe you for yesterday,

01:52.000 --> 01:53.039
and I always pay my debts.

01:53.600 --> 01:54.800
How about you owe me

01:55.120 --> 01:56.120
an even bigger one?

01:56.920 --> 01:57.720
What's your play here?

01:59.400 --> 02:00.560
Take my spot at the winter camp.

02:01.520 --> 02:02.760
You're handing it over to me?

02:05.080 --> 02:06.280
If you get Cao Ping

02:07.160 --> 02:08.720
and Xing Wu to settle their beef.

02:10.720 --> 02:12.000
Your brother already did a two-year stretch.

02:13.120 --> 02:14.720
You don't want him back in a cell,

02:15.240 --> 02:15.760
right?

02:17.360 --> 02:18.200
Why would I

02:18.200 --> 02:19.200
do you the favor?

02:20.200 --> 02:21.560
I've lost family.

02:24.600 --> 02:26.360
It ruins you.

02:27.680 --> 02:29.440
I'm going all out to protect mine,

02:31.160 --> 02:31.880
and I know

02:33.440 --> 02:34.640
you would

02:35.440 --> 02:36.760
do the same.

02:54.000 --> 02:54.760
Sweetie,

02:55.440 --> 02:56.880
get me some water.

02:59.160 --> 02:59.800
Sweetie?

03:00.840 --> 03:01.600
Wu!

03:04.160 --> 03:06.160
Are you alright?

03:07.600 --> 03:08.680
You seem miles away.

03:11.680 --> 03:12.320
Grandma...

03:13.840 --> 03:14.880
Just some

03:16.160 --> 03:17.000
old drama.

03:18.280 --> 03:19.560
It's time to put it to bed.

03:21.160 --> 03:22.560
You're a sweet boy,

03:23.440 --> 03:25.400
and I trust your judgment.

03:25.840 --> 03:27.120
I won't interfere.

03:28.079 --> 03:29.040
But promise me

03:29.040 --> 03:30.280
you'll protect yourself.

03:31.240 --> 03:32.800
Don't get hurt again

03:32.800 --> 03:33.560
like last time.

03:34.520 --> 03:35.200
Your mom,

03:35.560 --> 03:36.320
myself,

03:37.040 --> 03:39.160
and now Qing Ye...

03:39.920 --> 03:41.800
we'd all be devastated.

03:43.640 --> 03:45.600
There's always a smart way.

03:46.240 --> 03:47.800
Just look out for yourself.

03:50.880 --> 03:51.840
I will, Grandma.

03:52.760 --> 03:53.520
Trust me.

04:21.120 --> 04:22.400
Hello, Officer Xu.

05:16.600 --> 05:17.000
[Hello?]

06:22.160 --> 06:22.800
[Ping]

06:23.200 --> 06:24.360
[is gonna jump Xing Wu.]

06:24.600 --> 06:25.720
[We're heading there now.]

06:25.920 --> 06:27.120
[I called the police,]

06:27.560 --> 06:28.520
[they're on their way.]

07:01.200 --> 07:01.920
Where's Cao Ping?

07:02.640 --> 07:03.680
He doesn't

07:03.920 --> 07:05.400
do grunt work for a local scrub.

07:06.200 --> 07:06.720
Wreck him!

07:22.000 --> 07:23.440
Oh, so we got a

07:23.520 --> 07:24.320
martial artist here?

07:24.600 --> 07:25.280
Break his legs!

07:25.280 --> 07:25.880
Hold on!

07:34.080 --> 07:35.400
This beef is mine.

07:36.320 --> 07:37.400
Stay out of it.

07:40.120 --> 07:40.840
Cao Ping,

07:42.200 --> 07:43.800
we shouldn't settle our score

07:44.800 --> 07:46.040
like this.

07:47.320 --> 07:48.320
I'm not settling anything.

07:49.320 --> 07:50.960
I just wanna drag you

07:51.560 --> 07:53.120
into the same hell I've been in.

07:55.280 --> 07:57.040
I was in that hell

07:58.080 --> 07:59.760
two years ago.

08:00.840 --> 08:01.680
I should've

08:02.880 --> 08:03.760
thrown that game.

08:04.120 --> 08:05.160
You think that's even close?

08:06.280 --> 08:07.880
Two years in a cell,

08:08.560 --> 08:10.040
while my sister got bullied...

08:10.640 --> 08:11.880
You can never make up for that!

08:13.400 --> 08:14.040
I don't know what cr*p

08:14.040 --> 08:14.880
he told you,

08:15.720 --> 08:16.640
but Cao Fan's situation

08:16.960 --> 08:17.760
has zero to do

08:17.760 --> 08:18.840
with Qing Ye or me!

08:19.040 --> 08:19.360
Bro,

08:19.360 --> 08:20.520
why the speech?

08:20.520 --> 08:21.200
Just drop him!

08:21.200 --> 08:22.360
Did I ask for your opinion?

08:22.560 --> 08:23.040
Get lost!

08:24.720 --> 08:25.240
OK, my bad.

08:25.520 --> 08:26.120
Carry on.

08:32.640 --> 08:33.200
Cao Ping,

08:34.679 --> 08:35.440
I'm not

08:36.200 --> 08:37.360
planning to walk away.

08:38.919 --> 08:39.960
Let's settle this beef

08:40.679 --> 08:42.159
right now.

08:43.720 --> 08:44.680
Just keep your hands

08:45.840 --> 08:46.880
off Qing Ye.

08:49.840 --> 08:50.920
You think you're calling the shots?

09:29.320 --> 09:30.080
Once I wreck you,

09:30.960 --> 09:31.960
I'm gonna

09:32.560 --> 09:33.760
have some fun with your girl.

09:56.200 --> 09:56.800
Dude,

09:57.600 --> 09:58.520
just gut him.

10:17.280 --> 10:18.000
That's his ride!

10:18.120 --> 10:19.320
Inside! Pull!

10:21.800 --> 10:22.520
Xing Wu!

10:24.160 --> 10:25.200
- Xing Wu!
- Bro!

10:25.200 --> 10:25.960
Oh god...

10:29.880 --> 10:31.200
On your knees!

10:31.520 --> 10:32.280
You shouldn't be here.

10:32.560 --> 10:34.600
Please, just stop!

10:35.040 --> 10:35.840
Run!

10:37.280 --> 10:39.280
I'm begging you, stop!

10:39.280 --> 10:39.880
Get back!

10:40.240 --> 10:41.520
Aww, how sweet,

10:41.880 --> 10:43.360
the whole gang is here.

10:45.800 --> 10:46.520
Bro,

10:47.080 --> 10:48.000
finish him.

10:55.760 --> 10:56.440
No!

10:56.440 --> 10:57.360
Wu, no!

11:00.320 --> 11:01.240
- Wu...
- God!

11:01.240 --> 11:01.760
Qing Ye!

11:02.200 --> 11:02.960
Run...

11:06.640 --> 11:07.320
Ping!

11:14.360 --> 11:14.960
Please...

11:15.160 --> 11:16.680
put the knife down!

11:18.000 --> 11:19.360
He did nothing to you!

11:19.680 --> 11:20.400
Your prison time

11:20.400 --> 11:21.560
is your own fault!

11:21.760 --> 11:22.520
Cao Ping!

11:23.080 --> 11:24.320
If you hadn't sliced him back then,

11:24.320 --> 11:25.640
he'd be flying jets for the Air Force!

11:25.960 --> 11:27.560
You ruined his life, you bastard!

11:31.080 --> 11:31.560
Please!

11:31.880 --> 11:33.000
Just stop,

11:33.160 --> 11:34.400
please!

11:34.800 --> 11:35.720
I'm begging you!

11:36.080 --> 11:37.280
Qing Ye had nothing

11:37.440 --> 11:37.880
to do

11:37.880 --> 11:39.400
with me passing out!

11:39.640 --> 11:41.040
Xing Wu didn't do anything!

11:41.040 --> 11:41.840
Move up!

11:41.960 --> 11:43.800
Why can't you let go of the past?

11:44.200 --> 11:45.680
Don't ruin your life again!

11:45.720 --> 11:46.520
Please...

11:46.720 --> 11:49.240
Please! Put it down!

12:08.640 --> 12:09.880
Ping...

12:11.440 --> 12:12.040
Xing Wu!

12:12.320 --> 12:13.040
My god...

12:16.440 --> 12:17.280
I'm good...

12:30.520 --> 12:31.240
Wu!

12:31.560 --> 12:32.240
Wu...

12:44.800 --> 12:45.360
Round'em up!

12:48.680 --> 12:49.240
Ping...

12:49.720 --> 12:50.280
Dude...

12:52.240 --> 12:52.760
Wu...

12:53.160 --> 12:53.680
Hey!

12:54.000 --> 12:54.640
Wu, no!

12:55.320 --> 12:56.080
Please!

12:56.120 --> 12:56.880
Hey,

12:56.920 --> 12:58.360
stay with me!

12:58.400 --> 12:59.760
- Don't you die on me!
- Ouch...

12:59.960 --> 13:00.680
You idiot!

13:00.680 --> 13:02.200
He's in pain!

13:03.440 --> 13:04.360
Where does it hurt?

13:06.560 --> 13:07.040
Huh?

13:07.960 --> 13:08.520
Right here...

13:10.240 --> 13:10.640
What?

13:12.320 --> 13:13.200
My heart...

13:18.880 --> 13:19.360
Xing Wu,

13:19.680 --> 13:20.800
you guys are coming

13:20.920 --> 13:21.560
too!

13:27.640 --> 13:28.280
Ow, ow!

13:28.880 --> 13:29.960
Easy, Doc...

13:30.160 --> 13:30.680
Oh?

13:30.920 --> 13:31.440
God!

13:31.520 --> 13:32.520
Serves you right!

13:32.760 --> 13:33.520
Watch the hand...

13:33.840 --> 13:34.520
Grow up, kid.

13:34.880 --> 13:35.640
Still getting into fights?

13:36.440 --> 13:37.280
Doc, easy...

13:37.280 --> 13:38.600
Got booked by the cops too?

13:39.320 --> 13:40.680
Should I clap for you?

13:47.840 --> 13:49.000
There, you're all set.

13:49.000 --> 13:49.520
That's it?

13:50.320 --> 13:50.920
Qing Ye,

13:51.440 --> 13:52.640
keep him away

13:52.640 --> 13:53.280
from water.

13:53.640 --> 13:54.440
We don't want an infection.

13:54.800 --> 13:55.680
Keep his dressings fresh.

13:57.200 --> 13:57.720
Dr. Zhuang,

13:57.760 --> 13:59.400
should we get a second opinion?

13:59.400 --> 14:00.040
Maybe

14:00.040 --> 14:00.600
a CT

14:00.600 --> 14:01.160
or something?

14:01.160 --> 14:01.960
Save your money.

14:02.680 --> 14:03.520
The kid is

14:03.600 --> 14:04.640
built like a tank.

14:04.720 --> 14:05.600
He can take it.

14:06.040 --> 14:06.800
Just a scratch.

14:07.360 --> 14:08.200
Nothing serious.

14:08.680 --> 14:09.400
Relax.

14:09.840 --> 14:10.600
Told you.

14:10.760 --> 14:11.600
Dr. Zhuang

14:11.840 --> 14:12.720
is a wizard.

14:14.200 --> 14:14.680
Come, toots.

14:35.520 --> 14:37.160
Why did you pull a stunt like that

14:38.040 --> 14:39.240
without telling me?

14:40.640 --> 14:42.240
Why did you give up

14:43.760 --> 14:44.440
the spot?

14:48.040 --> 14:50.120
It is a game-changer

14:50.640 --> 14:52.040
for Cao Fan.

14:54.160 --> 14:55.320
And honestly,

14:56.520 --> 14:58.080
I know what my priority is.

15:05.120 --> 15:06.000
I'm so sorry.

15:08.760 --> 15:09.920
I was wrong to keep you

15:12.520 --> 15:13.320
in the dark.

15:14.520 --> 15:15.200
I get it.

15:15.880 --> 15:17.520
You like to

15:18.040 --> 15:19.440
bottle things up

15:20.040 --> 15:21.800
so you don't burden anyone.

15:22.440 --> 15:23.560
You think

15:24.440 --> 15:25.840
showing your feelings

15:26.440 --> 15:27.520
makes you look weak.

15:28.280 --> 15:29.520
But you can

15:30.360 --> 15:31.200
let

15:31.200 --> 15:32.280
your guard down

15:32.280 --> 15:33.080
with me.

15:34.280 --> 15:35.440
I don't want any walls

15:35.440 --> 15:36.320
between us.

15:37.720 --> 15:39.080
I just want the real you.

15:42.360 --> 15:42.920
I'm just

15:42.920 --> 15:44.320
used to

15:45.760 --> 15:46.840
fighting my own battles.

15:48.800 --> 15:49.840
And look where that got you.

15:52.080 --> 15:53.360
Cao Fan is

15:54.600 --> 15:55.960
everything to Cao Ping.

15:58.000 --> 15:59.160
And to me...

16:00.240 --> 16:01.360
you are my everything.

16:04.400 --> 16:06.120
I wanna hear

16:07.120 --> 16:08.240
your thoughts

16:10.600 --> 16:12.080
and share

16:12.560 --> 16:13.520
your burdens.

16:15.080 --> 16:16.800
I want to be that person

16:18.960 --> 16:20.440
for you.

16:36.720 --> 16:37.160
Alright.

16:38.920 --> 16:39.600
I got it.

16:43.640 --> 16:44.800
I just poured my heart out,

16:45.240 --> 16:46.760
and that's all I get?

16:47.160 --> 16:48.640
Do you actually get it?

16:51.400 --> 16:52.240
100%.

17:30.200 --> 17:31.000
Grandma,

17:31.520 --> 17:32.360
Auntie,

17:33.200 --> 17:34.320
relax.

17:35.120 --> 17:36.280
The doc said

17:37.360 --> 17:40.040
his injuries are purely cosmetic.

17:41.040 --> 17:42.080
He's fine.

17:51.040 --> 17:51.960
Look,

17:52.960 --> 17:54.520
I don't need you to be a hero.

17:55.440 --> 17:56.640
I just need you

17:57.160 --> 17:58.720
to stay safe

18:00.320 --> 18:01.680
and stop getting hurt.

18:02.680 --> 18:03.320
Deal?

18:06.880 --> 18:07.920
Listen to your mom.

18:08.560 --> 18:09.880
Own up to your mistake.

18:14.640 --> 18:15.160
Mom,

18:17.160 --> 18:17.840
I'm sorry.

18:18.920 --> 18:19.760
I promise,

18:21.080 --> 18:22.360
no more fighting.

18:37.920 --> 18:38.600
Here, put some meat back.

18:43.560 --> 18:44.400
Alright.

18:45.160 --> 18:46.000
Every cloud

18:46.440 --> 18:47.760
has a

18:47.800 --> 18:48.920
silver lining.

18:49.240 --> 18:50.120
Wu is

18:50.360 --> 18:51.400
cutting ties

18:51.400 --> 18:52.920
with his past,

18:53.040 --> 18:54.880
so he can grind

18:54.880 --> 18:55.880
with Qing Ye

18:56.440 --> 18:57.520
and secure his future.

19:01.280 --> 19:02.520
Got that?

19:07.000 --> 19:07.720
Now dig in!

19:07.720 --> 19:09.320
Yes, eat, everyone.

19:17.120 --> 19:18.600
Mom, this is awesome.

19:59.760 --> 20:01.280
You probably hate my guts.

20:03.720 --> 20:05.040
If hate actually worked,

20:05.240 --> 20:06.560
you wouldn't be locked up again.

20:11.240 --> 20:11.720
Listen, I...

20:11.720 --> 20:12.840
I don't hate you.

20:13.880 --> 20:15.120
I'm just tired of

20:16.440 --> 20:17.960
watching you ruin your life.

20:17.960 --> 20:19.160
You have a total victim mentality,

20:20.240 --> 20:21.000
blaming the world

20:21.040 --> 20:22.240
for your failures.

20:23.760 --> 20:24.440
But you just

20:24.960 --> 20:26.560
made the exact same mistake

20:27.040 --> 20:27.640
you did

20:27.640 --> 20:28.720
two years ago.

20:41.680 --> 20:42.920
I failed you as a brother.

20:46.720 --> 20:47.320
When you yelled

20:47.320 --> 20:48.720
my name that day,

20:50.520 --> 20:51.960
I realized I wasted those two years

20:51.960 --> 20:52.680
behind bars.

20:55.560 --> 20:56.280
I claimed

20:56.280 --> 20:57.720
I did all that for you.

21:00.600 --> 21:01.960
But I was

21:05.080 --> 21:05.600
actually

21:05.600 --> 21:06.640
just acting out.

21:09.840 --> 21:10.360
Ping...

21:11.280 --> 21:12.680
It's not too late to turn it around.

21:14.160 --> 21:14.800
I never blame you

21:14.800 --> 21:16.640
for my struggles

21:17.640 --> 21:18.640
or

21:19.040 --> 21:20.880
for serving time.

21:21.960 --> 21:22.920
If anything,

21:23.840 --> 21:24.520
the grind

21:24.520 --> 21:25.400
motivated me.

21:26.720 --> 21:27.840
I studied like hell

21:28.240 --> 21:29.200
because it was

21:29.200 --> 21:30.040
my golden ticket.

21:30.120 --> 21:30.880
So do your time,

21:34.640 --> 21:35.360
and let's hit reset

21:36.280 --> 21:37.240
when you're out.

21:37.920 --> 21:38.520
Alright?

21:41.040 --> 21:42.080
Hit reset?

21:44.960 --> 21:45.920
With my record?

21:47.600 --> 21:48.760
How?

21:52.640 --> 21:53.400
Xing Wu isn't

21:53.880 --> 21:54.920
pressing charges.

21:57.680 --> 21:58.720
Just promise me

21:59.280 --> 22:00.560
you'll keep your nose clean.

22:34.600 --> 22:35.720
Big news!

22:35.800 --> 22:36.760
Cao Fan is

22:36.800 --> 22:38.080
officially part of

22:38.080 --> 22:39.320
the squad!

22:39.640 --> 22:40.400
Let's hear it for her!

22:43.840 --> 22:44.800
Snack break!

22:50.640 --> 22:51.400
Ma'am,

22:52.920 --> 22:54.160
got room for another student?

22:59.760 --> 23:00.360
I guess.

23:00.840 --> 23:01.720
You can have my spot.

23:06.920 --> 23:07.360
Here is

23:07.520 --> 23:08.520
your daily grind.

23:27.400 --> 23:28.360
Stop slacking!

23:41.320 --> 23:41.760
Here,

23:42.000 --> 23:43.440
a little treat.

23:43.880 --> 23:44.520
Grandma,

23:45.040 --> 23:46.840
these buns are so cute!

23:47.120 --> 23:48.560
We got them blessed

23:48.800 --> 23:49.400
at the

23:49.400 --> 23:51.120
Sea Goddess shrine.

23:51.440 --> 23:52.520
Eat them, and you'll get

23:52.600 --> 23:53.760
straight-As

23:53.840 --> 23:54.840
on your finals!

23:54.960 --> 23:56.120
Thanks, Grandma!

23:56.160 --> 23:56.600
Go

23:56.680 --> 23:57.600
get'em, kids!

23:58.520 --> 23:59.520
We're about to crush this.

23:59.600 --> 24:01.080
Bless you both!

25:01.440 --> 25:02.720
[To be "dazzling"]

25:03.280 --> 25:03.960
[doesn't always mean to]

25:03.960 --> 25:05.440
[shine bright.]

25:06.840 --> 25:08.400
[Sometimes, it is clumsy,]

25:09.520 --> 25:10.360
[hesitant,]

25:11.440 --> 25:12.200
[goofy,]

25:13.640 --> 25:14.520
[silent,]

25:16.200 --> 25:17.040
[ordinary,]

25:19.080 --> 25:21.640
[and beautifully resilient.]

25:25.960 --> 25:26.920
[Some say]

25:27.640 --> 25:28.920
[life's made of only a handful of moments.]

25:30.600 --> 25:31.320
[But I disagree.]

25:32.880 --> 25:34.000
[Because when I look at her,]

25:34.680 --> 25:36.080
[every memory we've made]

25:36.960 --> 25:37.720
[is incredibly dazzling.]

25:41.600 --> 25:43.680
[And us, breaking the cycle and chasing the horizon,]

25:44.800 --> 25:46.720
[is the most dazzling thing of all!]

26:00.560 --> 26:01.720
Yo, drop that fast-food rap!

26:01.800 --> 26:02.680
Do it, do it!

26:03.120 --> 26:04.400
Two all-beef patties,

26:04.440 --> 26:05.200
special sauce,

26:05.280 --> 26:07.160
lettuce, cheese, pickles...

26:07.360 --> 26:07.880
You lost the beat.

26:09.640 --> 26:10.840
Wait, speaking of food,

26:11.000 --> 26:12.520
about that bet...

26:13.000 --> 26:13.960
Whoever got

26:14.040 --> 26:15.520
the worst grade

26:15.600 --> 26:16.600
has to buy us all skewers!

26:17.000 --> 26:17.800
Bet!

26:18.280 --> 26:19.040
Got enough cash?

26:21.880 --> 26:23.560
Why are you staring at me?

26:24.160 --> 26:26.760
Just accept your fate, bro.

26:29.280 --> 26:30.040
Look, my entire life savings!

26:31.040 --> 26:32.080
Does that even cover one meal?

26:32.400 --> 26:33.920
It covers two, easily.

26:34.320 --> 26:35.160
Deep breaths.

26:35.640 --> 26:36.320
You've put in

26:36.360 --> 26:37.320
so much effort.

26:38.280 --> 26:39.160
Mr. Zhu is here!

26:47.160 --> 26:48.200
Kids,

26:48.840 --> 26:50.360
final scores are locked in.

26:51.920 --> 26:53.240
The results ain't great...

26:59.760 --> 27:01.800
They're legendary!

27:05.200 --> 27:07.280
We completely smoked Class 1!

27:07.720 --> 27:09.240
We're top of the entire grade!

27:10.400 --> 27:12.520
And holding down first place is,

27:12.520 --> 27:13.680
of course, our...

27:13.760 --> 27:14.720
Princess Qing Ye!

27:17.400 --> 27:18.000
Congrats!

27:18.360 --> 27:19.200
Thank you.

27:19.760 --> 27:21.200
We also have

27:21.240 --> 27:23.200
some students who showed

27:23.240 --> 27:24.320
great improvement.

27:24.960 --> 27:27.000
Especially Shi Min!

27:27.080 --> 27:27.680
Slay!

27:28.440 --> 27:29.160
Told you so!

27:29.560 --> 27:30.720
She jumped up

27:31.000 --> 27:32.640
20 ranks.

27:32.960 --> 27:34.520
Incredible job!

27:35.000 --> 27:36.160
Thank you so much!

27:36.560 --> 27:37.240
Also,

27:37.880 --> 27:38.360
one of

27:38.400 --> 27:39.800
our guys completely

27:40.400 --> 27:41.840
blew me away.

27:43.160 --> 27:44.120
After

27:44.880 --> 27:46.200
being away for so long,

27:47.400 --> 27:49.560
he still got a near-perfect math score

27:49.880 --> 27:51.360
and made top tier

27:51.560 --> 27:52.600
in our class.

27:53.320 --> 27:54.280
S/O to...

27:55.320 --> 27:55.880
Xing Wu!

27:57.800 --> 27:58.560
Wu!

28:02.600 --> 28:03.960
Talk about a glow-up!

28:04.880 --> 28:07.120
Only because your tutoring was top-tier.

28:07.600 --> 28:10.360
Give yourself some credit.

28:13.920 --> 28:14.400
Alright!

28:15.720 --> 28:16.400
First,

28:16.840 --> 28:19.320
congrats to the squad for

28:19.440 --> 28:20.200
absolutely

28:20.280 --> 28:21.880
crushing finals!

28:22.080 --> 28:23.080
And a shoutout to the princess

28:23.240 --> 28:24.080
for holding down the top one spot.

28:24.440 --> 28:25.120
And to you,

28:25.320 --> 28:26.280
for getting the highest score in math!

28:28.160 --> 28:30.840
Shoutout to Ms. Qing

28:31.000 --> 28:33.200
for carrying us!

28:34.400 --> 28:35.440
Anytime.

28:35.520 --> 28:36.320
Chug, chug, chug!

28:36.400 --> 28:37.880
Cheers!

28:42.360 --> 28:43.240
Order whatever.

28:43.280 --> 28:43.880
Kyle's

28:44.120 --> 28:44.760
got the tab.

28:45.360 --> 28:45.840
Go crazy,

28:45.920 --> 28:47.040
it's dirt cheap anyway!

28:48.040 --> 28:48.680
Ye Yingjian,

28:49.040 --> 28:49.880
quick question...

28:50.960 --> 28:52.800
how's it feel losing the crown

28:52.800 --> 28:53.640
and settling

28:54.160 --> 28:55.320
for second?

28:55.520 --> 28:56.000
No complaints.

28:56.200 --> 28:57.600
Spill the beans!

28:59.360 --> 28:59.880
Fine,

29:00.320 --> 29:01.040
real talk...

29:02.640 --> 29:03.400
Not at all!

29:03.640 --> 29:05.000
I'm fine

29:05.160 --> 29:06.240
losing to her.

29:06.520 --> 29:08.080
Without her tutoring,

29:08.160 --> 29:08.840
my grades

29:08.840 --> 29:09.640
wouldn't have improved at all.

29:10.320 --> 29:10.960
Shi Min.

29:11.080 --> 29:11.640
This is for you.

29:12.600 --> 29:13.320
What's this?

29:14.000 --> 29:14.920
Exhibition tickets.

29:15.160 --> 29:16.520
To get your creative juices flowing

29:16.760 --> 29:18.200
before your art exams.

29:18.680 --> 29:19.720
Thanks so much!

29:20.000 --> 29:20.640
You've got this.

29:21.960 --> 29:22.640
Hey, Qing Ye.

29:22.840 --> 29:23.960
Mr. Zhu said

29:23.960 --> 29:25.160
you're in the top tier

29:25.280 --> 29:26.920
provincewide.

29:27.360 --> 29:28.840
Elite schools in Beijing

29:28.840 --> 29:29.760
will be begging for you.

29:31.240 --> 29:32.120
You're

29:32.120 --> 29:32.800
a shoo-in

29:32.800 --> 29:33.760
for Qingbei!

29:34.080 --> 29:34.600
Yeah.

29:34.800 --> 29:36.080
You wanted to do business, right?

29:36.320 --> 29:37.320
Their business school

29:37.320 --> 29:39.000
is top-ranked.

29:39.280 --> 29:40.920
It's basically a

29:40.920 --> 29:41.800
Wall Street pipeline.

29:42.160 --> 29:43.080
It's the

29:43.400 --> 29:44.440
perfect launchpad

29:44.560 --> 29:45.040
if you wanna

29:45.040 --> 29:46.080
study abroad.

29:52.320 --> 29:53.560
We'll see.

29:54.400 --> 29:55.760
Do it!

29:55.960 --> 29:56.400
If you

29:56.400 --> 29:57.160
move to Beijing,

29:57.160 --> 29:58.040
we can all come road-trip

29:58.240 --> 29:58.880
to see you.

29:59.440 --> 30:00.160
Right, Wu?

30:02.240 --> 30:02.880
Right.

30:06.080 --> 30:06.640
Here, eat up.

30:06.720 --> 30:08.520
These are ready.

30:08.680 --> 30:09.720
Kyle, your treat.

30:10.040 --> 30:10.600
First bite's yours.

30:10.960 --> 30:12.520
Nah, too spicy for me.

30:12.520 --> 30:13.240
These are ready too.

30:13.880 --> 30:14.680
Dig in, guys.

30:24.040 --> 30:25.040
Nothing beats

30:25.120 --> 30:27.320
red bean boba in winter.

30:28.000 --> 30:29.000
Sweet, chewy,

30:29.120 --> 30:30.560
and perfect after hotpot!

30:30.760 --> 30:31.400
Sweet!

30:44.640 --> 30:45.840
So, figured out

30:46.600 --> 30:47.520
where you're applying?

30:54.080 --> 30:56.040
After hanging out at Shi Min's,

30:56.600 --> 30:57.640
I've been thinking a lot.

30:58.920 --> 30:59.800
Look at Shi Min,

30:59.800 --> 31:00.960
Kyle, and Big G.

31:02.880 --> 31:03.560
They don't have

31:03.560 --> 31:04.800
specific schools in mind,

31:05.400 --> 31:06.440
but they have a clear path.

31:07.520 --> 31:08.080
But me?

31:08.840 --> 31:10.920
I've always had a goal,

31:11.880 --> 31:13.520
but now

31:14.280 --> 31:15.600
I'm not sure it's what I really want.

31:17.440 --> 31:18.080
Crazy, right?

31:18.520 --> 31:19.640
I fixed everyone else's

31:20.320 --> 31:20.920
problems,

31:20.920 --> 31:22.080
and now I'm the lost one.

31:27.040 --> 31:27.880
I wish...

31:33.200 --> 31:33.920
Wish what?

31:36.800 --> 31:37.400
[I wish]

31:38.880 --> 31:39.760
[you'd stay.]

31:43.640 --> 31:44.720
If I were you,

31:46.520 --> 31:48.160
I'd block out the noise.

31:48.720 --> 31:49.840
Just ask yourself

31:50.800 --> 31:51.440
what

31:52.080 --> 31:53.400
you truly want.

31:56.320 --> 31:57.560
What I truly want...

32:03.120 --> 32:03.680
Trust me,

32:04.960 --> 32:06.440
whatever I decide,

32:07.440 --> 32:08.960
it won't be a cop-out.

32:10.400 --> 32:11.600
It'll be what

32:12.960 --> 32:14.080
I actually want.

32:17.720 --> 32:18.360
Attagirl!

33:47.720 --> 33:48.360
Back for the holidays?

33:51.280 --> 33:52.000
Happy New Year!

33:53.120 --> 33:53.760
Look who's back!

33:57.280 --> 33:58.640
Man, you've gotten so tall!

34:11.040 --> 34:12.000
Here's some hot tea.

34:13.040 --> 34:13.760
Careful, it's hot.

34:14.159 --> 34:14.800
Here you go, ma'am.

34:14.800 --> 34:15.360
Thank you, honey.

34:16.760 --> 34:17.719
Ladies,

34:18.000 --> 34:19.639
have some treats.

34:19.760 --> 34:20.159
Please.

34:20.159 --> 34:20.760
Thanks, sweetie!

34:20.760 --> 34:21.520
Hang tight, guys.

34:21.880 --> 34:22.960
Enjoy the snacks.

34:23.000 --> 34:23.880
Let me know if you need anything.

34:24.000 --> 34:24.400
Will do!

34:24.639 --> 34:25.120
Ma'am,

34:25.199 --> 34:26.560
I'll just leave the snacks

34:26.560 --> 34:27.199
right here.

34:27.199 --> 34:27.639
Wu,

34:28.040 --> 34:29.360
I've been waiting forever.

34:30.120 --> 34:31.239
Bug your mom for me.

34:31.520 --> 34:32.880
Need to prep for the feast.

34:33.320 --> 34:34.080
Sorry about

34:34.080 --> 34:34.679
the wait.

34:35.520 --> 34:36.679
She's almost done

34:36.679 --> 34:37.360
with this one.

34:37.520 --> 34:38.400
You're up next,

34:38.400 --> 34:39.199
I promise.

34:39.320 --> 34:39.639
Alright, alright.

34:39.639 --> 34:40.080
Please.

34:40.280 --> 34:41.280
Have some candy.

34:41.360 --> 34:41.960
It'll make the wait sweeter!

34:42.000 --> 34:43.080
This girl

34:43.280 --> 34:44.199
is adorable.

34:44.639 --> 34:46.440
Can I adopt her already?

34:46.960 --> 34:48.040
Please, try this flavor!

34:48.080 --> 34:48.840
In your dreams!

34:48.960 --> 34:50.920
She's Lanfang's niece,

34:51.239 --> 34:52.719
practically her own daughter.

34:53.239 --> 34:54.320
You try,

34:54.360 --> 34:55.320
and Lanfang will throw you out!

34:55.679 --> 34:57.320
I'm just jealous!

34:57.360 --> 34:58.600
Handsome son,

34:58.720 --> 34:59.120
and

34:59.120 --> 35:00.560
gorgeous niece...

35:00.680 --> 35:01.320
such a

35:01.560 --> 35:03.160
good-looking family!

35:03.200 --> 35:04.280
Thanks!

35:04.520 --> 35:05.440
Seriously, so jealous.

35:06.080 --> 35:06.680
Ladies,

35:06.680 --> 35:07.400
shout if you

35:07.400 --> 35:08.560
need anything!

35:08.560 --> 35:10.040
Bottomless snacks

35:10.040 --> 35:10.760
today!

35:11.080 --> 35:11.640
How is it?

35:12.000 --> 35:13.160
Love it?

35:14.520 --> 35:16.160
Lanfang, you're a genius!

35:16.400 --> 35:17.440
Absolutely love it.

35:17.680 --> 35:19.000
Perfect!

35:19.000 --> 35:19.520
Thanks.

35:19.880 --> 35:20.680
Here's your coat.

35:20.800 --> 35:21.240
Wu!

35:21.440 --> 35:21.760
Right this way!

35:21.760 --> 35:22.520
Check!

35:22.520 --> 35:23.040
Scan right here.

35:23.240 --> 35:23.960
Alright!

35:24.040 --> 35:24.800
You're up!

35:24.840 --> 35:25.400
No need.

35:25.400 --> 35:26.760
You've got credit on your account.

35:26.760 --> 35:27.520
I'll just deduct it.

35:28.200 --> 35:29.400
Oh, great. Thanks!

35:29.760 --> 35:30.440
Lanfang,

35:30.880 --> 35:31.520
work your

35:31.520 --> 35:32.360
magic!

35:32.440 --> 35:33.400
My whole New Year

35:33.520 --> 35:34.360
look

35:34.960 --> 35:35.840
is on you!

35:36.360 --> 35:38.040
Trust me, you'll love it.

35:38.520 --> 35:39.600
Can you do that

35:39.600 --> 35:40.320
root lift like her?

35:40.640 --> 35:41.640
You got it.

35:41.760 --> 35:43.120
Mega volume, guaranteed.

35:43.200 --> 35:43.600
Perfect.

35:43.640 --> 35:44.960
Tallest

35:44.960 --> 35:45.520
in town.

35:45.520 --> 35:47.120
You'll be catching Wi-Fi up there.

35:47.640 --> 35:48.720
Oh, stop it!

35:49.080 --> 35:49.880
Just do your magic.

35:50.120 --> 35:50.960
Alrighty!

35:51.040 --> 35:52.080
On it, on it!

35:54.800 --> 35:56.000
Have a good night!

35:57.280 --> 35:58.320
It looks gorgeous!

35:58.960 --> 35:59.920
See you next time!

35:59.920 --> 36:00.560
Bye!

36:00.600 --> 36:01.560
Happy New Year!

36:09.360 --> 36:11.160
Ugh, finally! We survived today.

36:11.920 --> 36:12.520
Come here, sweetie.

36:13.040 --> 36:13.600
Oh, Mom...

36:13.600 --> 36:15.200
Take a breather.

36:15.280 --> 36:16.600
Thanks, Mom.

36:17.640 --> 36:18.760
Hell of a job, Boss.

36:19.680 --> 36:20.680
I'll go prep that leftover foot soak thing

36:20.680 --> 36:21.600
Dr. Zhuang gave us.

36:21.600 --> 36:22.320
Try to keep you alive.

36:23.800 --> 36:24.920
Aren't you a saint?

36:26.120 --> 36:26.800
Honestly, I didn't

36:26.800 --> 36:27.920
drink all day

36:27.920 --> 36:29.120
just to avoid bathroom breaks.

36:29.400 --> 36:30.160
My hands are

36:30.160 --> 36:31.640
completely numb.

36:34.240 --> 36:35.040
Mom, you're the best.

36:35.040 --> 36:36.040
I got the other one!

36:36.360 --> 36:37.000
Love you, son.

36:37.000 --> 36:37.960
Alright,

36:37.960 --> 36:39.400
awesome news.

36:40.000 --> 36:41.440
It was brutal,

36:41.840 --> 36:42.520
but this month

36:42.760 --> 36:44.600
we made more than

36:45.080 --> 36:46.600
the last six months combined!

36:47.680 --> 36:48.560
No way!

36:49.760 --> 36:50.400
Yep!

36:51.080 --> 36:52.160
Let's do the math.

37:00.520 --> 37:01.000
Well?

37:01.280 --> 37:02.040
What's the damage?

37:02.800 --> 37:03.920
So, we averaged

37:03.920 --> 37:05.720
about a grand a day,

37:06.120 --> 37:08.120
even with a slow start to the month.

37:08.560 --> 37:09.880
Which brings

37:09.920 --> 37:11.560
our grand total to...

37:11.840 --> 37:13.560
25k!

37:13.920 --> 37:15.200
That's insane!

37:18.240 --> 37:19.160
Not to be a party pooper,

37:19.560 --> 37:21.400
but everyone's broke after the holidays,

37:21.840 --> 37:23.320
so business will definitely tank.

37:23.880 --> 37:24.520
Oh, true...

37:25.120 --> 37:26.360
That was just

37:26.360 --> 37:27.360
our gross income.

37:27.680 --> 37:29.040
After subtracting

37:29.040 --> 37:30.720
overhead, supplies,

37:30.760 --> 37:31.960
and utilities,

37:32.400 --> 37:34.280
our actual profit is...

37:35.080 --> 37:37.320
11,897!

37:38.000 --> 37:39.400
We cleared that much?

37:40.600 --> 37:41.760
So... so that means

37:41.800 --> 37:42.920
we're in the green,

37:42.920 --> 37:44.040
and I'm officially a five-figure woman!

37:44.040 --> 37:44.960
You sure are!

37:45.520 --> 37:46.200
Grandma, look!

37:46.240 --> 37:47.840
Let me count the digits...

37:47.840 --> 37:50.520
1, 2, 3, 4...

37:51.520 --> 37:52.760
My goodness!

37:53.200 --> 37:54.280
Grandma, we made bank!

37:54.320 --> 37:55.920
We're in the money!

37:56.000 --> 37:58.880
We're rich!

37:59.120 --> 37:59.920
Rich!

37:59.960 --> 38:00.760
Unbelievable...

38:01.520 --> 38:03.360
Best day ever!

38:03.360 --> 38:04.560
Oh my gosh!

38:15.040 --> 38:16.280
You guys, this is huge.

38:16.760 --> 38:18.080
Now I can

38:18.240 --> 38:19.000
finally

38:19.120 --> 38:21.680
pay back Shanxi,

38:21.680 --> 38:22.800
and Yufen,

38:22.800 --> 38:23.920
and even Mr. Zhao!

38:23.920 --> 38:25.520
I can pay off all my debts!

38:26.880 --> 38:28.160
Unbelievable!

38:28.160 --> 38:28.880
Lanfang,

38:28.920 --> 38:31.240
I'm so proud of you.

38:32.160 --> 38:33.160
Thanks, Mom.

38:35.600 --> 38:36.200
Liu Nian,

38:36.320 --> 38:37.040
come sit.

38:38.200 --> 38:38.920
Honestly,

38:39.000 --> 38:39.600
I

38:40.160 --> 38:41.320
wanna thank you guys.

38:41.640 --> 38:43.040
Ye, Liu Nian,

38:43.320 --> 38:45.080
and my amazing son.

38:45.680 --> 38:46.880
Thank you all so, so much.

38:47.280 --> 38:48.360
You too, Lanfang!

38:48.400 --> 38:50.080
Alright, save the waterworks!

38:50.600 --> 38:51.320
Yeah, Auntie.

38:51.440 --> 38:52.080
You're a

38:52.080 --> 38:53.240
boss babe now.

38:53.280 --> 38:54.560
You gotta make us rich!

38:54.760 --> 38:55.160
Heck yeah!

38:55.520 --> 38:55.920
You know it!

38:55.960 --> 38:58.000
I'm the boss now!

38:58.200 --> 38:59.560
We are all getting rich.

38:59.840 --> 39:00.680
Liu Nian,

39:01.120 --> 39:01.880
this is for you.

39:02.280 --> 39:02.800
Lanfang...

39:02.880 --> 39:04.160
Sit down, sit down.

39:04.160 --> 39:04.760
What is this?

39:04.840 --> 39:06.200
Your holiday bonus. Take it!

39:06.520 --> 39:07.720
This is too much.

39:07.720 --> 39:08.280
You earned it.

39:08.680 --> 39:09.960
And you're getting

39:10.040 --> 39:10.960
a raise next year.

39:11.640 --> 39:12.200
Take it, man.

39:12.320 --> 39:13.840
Yes, keep it!

39:13.960 --> 39:14.800
Yeah!

39:14.880 --> 39:15.400
I won't say no to that!

39:15.400 --> 39:15.880
Put it away!

39:15.880 --> 39:16.520
Thanks, Lanfang.

39:17.040 --> 39:19.320
One last

39:19.520 --> 39:21.040
shift tomorrow,

39:21.440 --> 39:24.120
and then we party!

39:24.360 --> 39:25.440
Hell yeah!

39:25.520 --> 39:26.600
Let's make this

39:26.600 --> 39:27.880
the best

39:27.960 --> 39:29.120
New Year ever!

39:29.200 --> 39:31.000
Happy New Year!

39:31.120 --> 39:33.040
To wealth and health!

39:39.120 --> 39:40.000
I'm off, Wu!

39:41.320 --> 39:42.240
Take care!

39:42.360 --> 39:42.800
Safe travels.

39:42.800 --> 39:43.440
Thanks! Bye!

39:43.680 --> 39:44.160
See ya!

39:44.240 --> 39:44.760
Later!

39:49.920 --> 39:50.760
Blessings for the New Year!

39:52.040 --> 39:53.080
Do I need to bow?

39:53.200 --> 39:53.600
Say no more.

39:53.600 --> 39:54.160
Stop that!

39:54.600 --> 39:55.840
It's not for you

39:55.880 --> 39:56.360
anyway.

39:56.960 --> 39:57.720
Who's it for, then?

39:59.440 --> 40:00.720
The holiday market

40:00.720 --> 40:02.080
is tomorrow.

40:02.600 --> 40:04.320
Take your princess

40:04.320 --> 40:05.280
shopping.

40:06.000 --> 40:06.960
She's been here so long,

40:07.000 --> 40:08.240
and you've never spoiled her.

40:08.840 --> 40:09.400
Of course,

40:09.720 --> 40:10.800
you can buy something

40:10.800 --> 40:11.520
for yourself, too.

40:13.000 --> 40:14.080
500?

40:14.080 --> 40:14.760
Big spender!

40:15.400 --> 40:16.440
Oh, please.

40:16.440 --> 40:18.040
Don't be so dramatic.

40:18.040 --> 40:19.360
Just so you know,

40:19.960 --> 40:21.000
I am

40:21.200 --> 40:21.960
a self-made

40:22.400 --> 40:25.160
business woman!

40:26.560 --> 40:27.440
Which makes you...

40:27.440 --> 40:29.240
a wealthy heir!

40:29.720 --> 40:31.440
Look at my walk!

40:33.000 --> 40:34.680
Don't pull a muscle with that ego!

40:35.200 --> 40:37.040
Watch me!

40:51.280 --> 40:52.160
Candied fruit!

40:52.640 --> 40:54.160
Sweet and tart!

40:55.640 --> 40:56.800
Best in town! Eat your heart!

41:02.200 --> 41:03.520
Whoa, it's packed!

41:03.600 --> 41:04.320
Wild, right?

41:05.080 --> 41:06.160
The holiday market

41:06.240 --> 41:06.960
is

41:06.960 --> 41:08.360
a huge deal.

41:08.600 --> 41:09.120
It's when everyone

41:09.120 --> 41:10.240
gets ready for the New Year.

41:10.920 --> 41:12.320
Well, I need to start shopping then!

41:12.920 --> 41:14.000
Candied fruit!

41:14.280 --> 41:15.440
Balloons!

41:15.920 --> 41:16.800
Balloons!

41:16.920 --> 41:17.880
I gotta get one!

41:18.200 --> 41:19.200
A balloon?

41:19.680 --> 41:21.080
Alright, don't run.

41:21.520 --> 41:22.960
Want one, sweetie?

41:23.320 --> 41:24.880
Yes, please!

41:25.080 --> 41:25.560
Alright.

41:25.800 --> 41:26.520
Which one?

41:27.360 --> 41:28.080
The fish!

41:28.320 --> 41:29.280
It fits the beach vibe.

41:30.120 --> 41:31.280
What an adorable girl!

41:31.520 --> 41:32.040
Thank you!

41:32.040 --> 41:33.360
I've got this.

41:34.920 --> 41:36.360
Ooh, roasted seeds!

41:36.920 --> 41:37.440
Hey,

41:37.680 --> 41:38.360
can we try?

41:38.360 --> 41:39.240
Go for it!

41:39.520 --> 41:40.360
Caramel!

41:43.600 --> 41:44.640
Yes, these are the ones.

41:44.640 --> 41:45.560
Try this one, plum-flavored.

41:46.960 --> 41:48.200
Oh, let's get these too.

41:48.200 --> 41:48.520
Sure thing.

41:48.680 --> 41:49.680
Cream?

41:51.640 --> 41:52.440
- Nah...
- How about a peanut?

41:54.160 --> 41:54.880
Thank you!

41:56.080 --> 41:57.680
Look! Candied fruit!

41:58.400 --> 41:59.000
That's seven.

41:59.640 --> 42:00.720
Best in town!

42:01.280 --> 42:02.800
Eat your heart!

42:03.960 --> 42:04.800
Candied fruit!

42:04.800 --> 42:05.320
Hey,

42:05.600 --> 42:06.240
I'll take a...

42:06.800 --> 42:07.200
Miss,

42:07.200 --> 42:08.080
what's your pick?

42:08.520 --> 42:09.360
Candied crab?

42:09.640 --> 42:10.360
Squid?

42:11.000 --> 42:11.840
Or maybe

42:12.040 --> 42:12.800
the mantis shrimp?

42:12.920 --> 42:14.520
- This is...
- Slight change of heart?

42:14.760 --> 42:15.840
pretty hardcore...

42:15.840 --> 42:17.160
You actually candy seafood here?

42:17.240 --> 42:18.520
It's a local delicacy!

42:19.640 --> 42:20.120
Right...

42:20.520 --> 42:21.360
after you.

42:21.760 --> 42:24.360
I'll check out the decorations!

42:24.760 --> 42:25.320
Alright, buddy.

42:25.320 --> 42:26.200
Which one for you?

42:28.680 --> 42:30.120
I love this place.

42:30.160 --> 42:31.360
The street food is unreal!

42:34.160 --> 42:34.840
Here,

42:34.840 --> 42:35.440
have a bite!

42:36.440 --> 42:37.680
You keep it.

42:37.720 --> 42:38.400
Not that hungry.

42:38.880 --> 42:39.840
C'mon, one bite!

42:40.200 --> 42:40.680
But...

42:42.320 --> 42:43.000
you already bit it.

42:43.000 --> 42:43.760
I would've gotten my own

42:43.760 --> 42:45.000
if I wanted one.

42:46.400 --> 42:47.400
Oh, you're too good for my leftovers?

42:48.520 --> 42:48.960
Eat up!

42:54.640 --> 42:55.320
Told you!

42:56.040 --> 42:57.160
Wow. You're right!

43:00.960 --> 43:02.520
Oh, this beanie is so cute!

43:03.080 --> 43:04.400
What do you think?

43:04.440 --> 43:05.080
Try some on, miss.

43:05.120 --> 43:05.720
Looks cool.

43:06.800 --> 43:07.440
What about this one?

43:07.960 --> 43:08.840
Also cool.

43:10.320 --> 43:11.040
"Cool, cool..."

43:11.160 --> 43:11.960
Literally zero help.

43:13.000 --> 43:13.800
I'm serious!

43:14.040 --> 43:15.080
Note to self:

43:15.080 --> 43:16.920
never go shopping with men.

43:18.560 --> 43:19.800
What about these?

43:20.040 --> 43:20.920
Yeah, those are dope too.

43:22.080 --> 43:22.800
Honestly.

43:23.160 --> 43:23.560
Alright,

43:23.880 --> 43:24.360
we'll

43:24.400 --> 43:25.280
take these two.

43:25.320 --> 43:25.800
You got it.

43:25.840 --> 43:26.600
This is for you.

43:26.880 --> 43:28.520
Thanks for being my pack mule today!

43:28.640 --> 43:29.120
Thanks.
